OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after suspected
OL,4,Abomb found in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople were evacuated from their homes
OL,7,Fafter police discovered a suspected
OL,8,Fbomb in a car parked in a residential
OL,9,Fstreet.
OL,11,FDorset Police officers made the
OL,12,Fdiscovery in a vehicle in Sherwood
OL,13,FAvenue, in Poole, at about 22:20 GMT on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FAn Explosive Ordnance Disposal team was
OL,17,Fcalled to the scene and made the
OL,18,Fsuspected explosive device safe, the
OL,19,Fforce said.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
