OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after suspected
OL,4,Abomb found in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cordon was placed around the scene
OL,7,Fand properties in the immediate
OL,8,Fvicinity were evacuated. No arrests
OL,9,Fhave been made and Dorset Police said
OL,10,Fit was continuing to investigate the
OL,11,Fincident.
